		{
			title: "Dig Up a Worm"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
			subtitle: "Aquaculture + Fish of Thieves + Kaleidoscope Cookery"
			description: [
				"The waters of this world are older than the land and twice as alive: over thirty species from \u00a7eAquaculture 2\u00a7r and the rare shoals of \u00a7eFish of Thieves\u00a7r."
				""
				"This chapter is about \u00a7bkeeping\u00a7r them: catching them alive, housing them, feeding them, and completing the great collection."
				""
				"Start where every naturalist starts: dig up a worm (break grass, till dirt). Bait, not dinner."
			]
